!Series_summary = UM171 and TCP1 effect in AML1 cellsengeneered to express low levels of KBTBD4 and/or RCOR1
!Series_overall_design = OCI-AML1 cell line engeneered to expressed either sgRNA AAVS1 (CT) or sgRNA against KBTBD4  and either shRNA luciferase or shRNA against RCOR1 were exposed to DMSO, UM171, UM134 or TCP1 for different time points. RNA were extracted and sequences were obtained with an Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencer.
